{"id":"0f3f51ff44894234","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-loop-space.md","title":"Loop Space","display":"df-loop-space — Loop Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-loop-space","aliases":["58-df-loop-space","Free Loop Space","Loop Space"],"display":"df-loop-space — Loop Space","depends_on":["[[58-df-topological-space]]","[[58-df-continuous-map]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-loop-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-loop-space</span><span>Free Loop Space</span><span>Loop Space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-loop-space — Loop Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau_X,\\Omega,x_0\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau_X,\\Omega,x_0\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"58-df-continuous-map\">58-df-continuous-map</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LoopSpace}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{LoopSpace}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (本文件定义的 based-loop 载体关系)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{LoopSpace}_S(\\Omega,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\exists I,\\tau_I\\in V\\;\\Biggl(I=[0,1]\\land\\tau_I=\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(a&lt;x&lt;b\\land I\\cap\\{r\\in\\mathbb R:a&lt;r&lt;b\\}\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\Omega=\\{\\gamma\\in X^I:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,I,\\tau_I,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_0\\}\\Biggr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{LoopSpace}_S(\\Omega,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\exists I,\\tau_I\\in V\\;\\Biggl(I=[0,1]\\land\\tau_I=\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(a&lt;x&lt;b\\land I\\cap\\{r\\in\\mathbb R:a&lt;r&lt;b\\}\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\Omega=\\{\\gamma\\in X^I:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,I,\\tau_I,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_0\\}\\Biggr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span>: based-loop carrier at <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span>；连续性显式依赖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 的拓扑。</li>\n<li>Fundamental group <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi_1(X, x_0) = [\\Omega X]\">\\(\\pi_1(X, x_0) = [\\Omega X]\\)</span></li>\n<li>若要把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega\">\\(\\Omega\\)</span> 本身变成拓扑空间，还需另行赋予 compact-open 拓扑；本原子只定义载体。</li>\n<li>Free loop space: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"LX = \\{\\gamma : S^1 \\to X\\}\">\\(LX = \\{\\gamma : S^1 \\to X\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li>Loop space is an H-space with concatenation</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hatcher, Algebraic Topology, Chapter 4</li>\n<li>May, A Concise Course in Algebraic Topology</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-continuous-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2$ (see [[58-df-topological-space]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-continuous-map","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5$ (see [[58-df-continuous-map]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\tau_X,\\Omega,x_0\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LoopSpace}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}loop\\text{-}space} \\vdash \\mathrm{LoopSpace}_S(\\Omega,X,\\tau_X,x_0)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land x_0\\in X\\land\\exists I,\\tau_I\\in V\\;\\Biggl(I=[0,1]\\land\\tau_I=\\Bigl\\{U\\subseteq I:\\forall x\\in U\\;\\exists a,b\\in\\mathbb R\\;\\bigl(a<x<b\\land I\\cap\\{r\\in\\mathbb R:a<r<b\\}\\subseteq U\\bigr)\\Bigr\\}\\land\\Omega=\\{\\gamma\\in X^I:\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\gamma,I,\\tau_I,X,\\tau_X)\\land\\gamma(0)=x_0\\land\\gamma(1)=x_0\\}\\Biggr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi_1(X, x_0) = [\\Omega X]","display":false},{"tex":"\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"LX = \\{\\gamma : S^1 \\to X\\}","display":false}],"bytes":1534,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a24e3f8bb40a4b5","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-800","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-loop-space.md|58-df-loop-space]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["815e63e5071e7b58","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}